    ("CV / SV", "CV = EV − AC; SV = EV − PV. Negative = over budget / behind schedule."),
    ("CPI / SPI", "CPI = EV / AC; SPI = EV / PV. Below 1 = bad."),
    ("EAC (typical)", "EAC = BAC / CPI. Atypical: AC + (BAC − EV). With CPI×SPI: AC + (BAC − EV)/(CPI × SPI)."),
